flowchart TD
  A[Build request] --> B{Tokens available?}
  B -->|no| C[Wait / queue]
  C --> B
  B -->|yes| D[Send HTTP]
  D --> E{Status}
  E -->|2xx| F[Parse / stream]
  E -->|429| G[Backoff + Retry-After]
  G --> B
  E -->|5xx idempotent| H[Exponential backoff]
  H --> D
  E -->|4xx other| I[Fail closed]
